# Version 1 Definition

HbTK Version 1 is complete when Hackedbox has a functioning visual toolkit and StyleEngine capable of supporting both:

```
Classic Hackedbox / Blackbox appearance
```

and:

```
New HbTK-designed styles
```

without requiring application source-code changes for ordinary visual customization.

The ultimate objective is not simply to make Hackedbox look newer.

The objective is to give Hackedbox a **real, extensible theming system** in which the user can design the appearance of the desktop and its visual components through HbTK.

1.0 should therefore represent a mature visual toolkit and styling foundation, not merely the next numerical release.
